Product Image Rendering Architecture
The universal AspectImage component prevents layout shifts and protects against unsafe remote resources:
 * Configurable Properties: aspectRatio (1/1, 4/5, 4/3, 3/4, 16/9), fitMode (contain | cover), surfaceBg (subtle | white | transparent), position (center | top).
 * Contain Padding Guard: When contain is active, inner padding (var(--card-image-padding, 10px)) ensures transparent or square product cutouts never bleed into card borders.
 * Loading & Error Fallbacks: Neutral skeleton pulse during loading; on image load error (onError), surfaces a minimal store/product monogram icon with a neutral surface background (--surface-subtle) without broken browser image icons.
Universal Product Card & Inventory Integrity
 * Server-Authoritative Stock Display:
   * trackInventory: false \rightarrow No stock badge; assumed in-stock.
   * In Stock (availableQuantity > lowStockThreshold) \rightarrow No badge (minimizes visual noise).
   * Low Stock (trackInventory: true && availableQuantity <= lowStockThreshold && > 0) \rightarrow Exact count: "လက်ကျန် X ခု" / "X left in stock".
   * Out of Stock \rightarrow Muted pill badge "ပစ္စည်းကုန်နေပါသည်" / "Sold Out", opacity 0.75, Quick-Add disabled.
 * Variant-Specific Availability: Card-level reflects aggregate status; PDP/Quick-Select sheets disable specific variant pills (e.g., strikethrough unavailable size M).
 * Quick-Add Eligibility: Direct 1-tap + is permitted only when product.variants.length === 0 && isAvailable === true && !hasCustomRequiredModifiers. Otherwise, it resolves to "ရွေးချယ်ရန်" / "Options".
 * Price Validation: Compare-at price and discount badges render strictly when compareAtPrice > currentPrice && currentPrice > 0. Negative discounts or 0% are structurally barred.
Homepage Section Composition Architecture
To prevent arbitrary JSX execution or unsafe code evaluation, merchant customization relies on a strict schema-driven Section Registry:
[Storefront Config JSON (v1)] ──► [Zod Strict Schema Validator] ──► [Allowlisted Section Registry] ──► [Per-Section ErrorBoundary] ──► [Render]

 * Allowlisted Section Registry: Supports only HERO_BANNER, CATEGORY_RAIL, PRODUCT_SHELF, PROMO_SPLIT, TRUST_BAR, FEATURED_COLLECTIONS. Unknown types are safely skipped with a development warning.
 * Zero-Config Default Guarantee: Falls back gracefully to DEFAULT_STOREFRONT_CONFIG_V1 if no custom layout is provided.
 * Per-Section Isolation: Empty data sources trigger graceful collapses rather than blank container boxes.
PLP / PDP / Cart / Checkout UX
 * PLP & Category Browsing: Sticky category pill rail with sort/filter bottom sheets (price range, availability, categories).
 * PDP: Swipeable image gallery carousel (mobile) or thumbnail grid (desktop); reactive variant matrix updates.
 * Cart Drawer & Re-Verification: Incremental quantity steps (+) are blocked if they exceed server stock, displaying inline warnings.
 * Myanmar-Optimized Checkout: Clean integer MMK currency formatting (45,000 MMK), phone-first customer inputs (09... validation with optional email), region/township hierarchical selection, and truthful merchant-configured payment methods (KBZPay, WavePay, COD, Bank Transfer).
Empty, Error & Loading States
 * Empty Storefront: Header, Brand Hero, and "ဆိုင်ခန်း ပြင်ဆင်နေဆဲ ဖြစ်ပါသည် — မကြာမီ ပစ္စည်းသစ်များ ရောက်ရှိပါမည်" banner with contact links.
 * Empty Category: "ဤအမျိုးအစားတွင် ပစ္စည်း မရှိသေးပါ" with "Browse All Products" CTA and active category recommendations.
 * Search with No Results: "[Query] အတွက် ပစ္စည်းရှာမတွေ့ပါ" with spelling check suggestions, clear search button, and popular product shelves.
 * Out-of-Stock (PDP/PLP): Disabled "Out of Stock" button with alternative in-stock recommendations from the same category.
 * Slow Network (3G / Unstable): Layout-stable skeleton placeholders, 300ms debounced search inputs, and loading spinners with disabled states to prevent double-taps.
 * Image Load Failure: AspectImage onError handler swapping broken states to neutral placeholder surfaces immediately.
 * API Fetch Failure: Section-level or page-level fallback with "အင်တာနက်ချိတ်ဆက်မှု အခက်အခဲရှိနေပါသည်" and a functional Retry button.
 * Cart Stock Re-Verification Failure: Inline warning badge ("လက်ကျန် X ခုသာ ကျန်ပါတော့သည်") with automatic quantity adjustment prompts.
 * Checkout Validation / Submission Errors: Preserved form state; inline red error text under failing inputs with auto-scroll and focus assignment.
 * Long Titles / Mixed Text: line-clamp-2 with overflow-wrap: anywhere preventing horizontal card leaks.
