Performance & Accessibility
 * Measurable Performance Targets:
   * LCP \le 2.5s: Enforced via fetchpriority="high" and loading="eager" on hero images and first two product cards; lazy loading for below-the-fold assets.
   * INP \le 200ms: Achieved via optimistic UI feedback, 300ms debounced search inputs, and avoidance of heavy synchronous main-thread computations.
   * CLS \le 0.1: Guaranteed through explicit CSS aspect-ratio containers, reserved header/banner minimum heights, and font-display: swap.
 * Accessibility (a11y) Standards:
   * Focus Management: Visible 2px focus rings (--brand-primary, 2px offset) on all interactive controls; focus traps in modals and drawers with Escape key dismissal.
   * Screen Readers: Explicit aria-label attributes on icon-only controls; aria-live="polite" for cart badge updates.
   * Touch Targets: Minimum 44px \times 44px hit areas on mobile viewports.
   * Reduced Motion: Respects prefers-reduced-motion: reduce by zeroing out non-essential animation durations.
